    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Include a notarised statement confirming the photocopy’s authenticity if required by the carrier.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>2. <strong>Current Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Provide the latest PUC stamp or digital certificate, valid for at least 30 days from the date of transport.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Carriers often verify the PUC at the departure point to comply with environmental regulations.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Retain the original PUC for inspection by customs or port authorities.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>3. <strong>Valid Insurance Certificate</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Submit a copy of the vehicle’s active insurance policy covering third‑party liability.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Verify that the policy includes coverage for marine transit if the vehicle will be shipped.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Keep the original certificate on hand for any claim or audit.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>4. <strong>IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The International Bank of Africa (IBA) consignment bilty serves as the official transport contract.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>It details the consignor, consignee, freight terms, and the agreed freight rate.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Ensure the bilty is signed by both parties and stamped by the IBA representative.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>5. <strong>100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance</strong></p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>When shipping by sea, opt for marine transit insurance that covers the full declared value of the vehicle.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>This policy protects against damage, loss, or theft during loading, transit, and unloading.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Keep the insurance policy number and coverage details handy for customs clearance.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>By assembling these documents—self‑attested RC, current PUC, valid insurance, IBA consignment bilty, and 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance—you streamline the transport process, satisfy regulatory authorities, and safeguard your investment from unforeseen incidents.</p></div>
